---
import { company } from "../../data/company";
import { countryList, href } from "../../i18n";

const carriers = company.carriers.join(", ").replace(/, ([^,]*)$/, " and $1");
const days = company.withdrawalDays;
const names = countryList(company.shippingCountries, "en").map((c) => c.name);
const countries = `${names.slice(0, -1).join(", ")} and ${names.at(-1)}`;
---

<h2>1. General information</h2>
<p>
  {company.legalName}<br />
  {company.address.map((l) => <>{l === "Danmark" ? "Denmark" : l}<br /></>)}
  VAT: {company.vat}<br />
  Phone: <a href={company.phoneHref}>{company.phone}</a><br />
  Email: <a href={`mailto:${company.serviceEmail}`}>{company.serviceEmail}</a>
</p>

<h2>2. Age limit</h2>
<p>
  We only sell to people aged 18 or over. By placing an order you confirm that you are 18 or older. If we are in doubt about your
  age, we may cancel the order and refund the amount.
</p>

<h2>3. Prices</h2>
<p>
  At {company.legalName}, all prices are stated in DKK and include local VAT and taxes where applicable. We reserve the right to
  change prices from day to day without prior notice. All orders are subject to availability and items being in stock.
</p>

<h2>4. Payment</h2>
<p>{company.legalName} accepts the following payment methods: VISA and Mastercard.</p>
<p>
  The payment is only debited from your account once the order is dispatched. All amounts are charged in DKK. We reserve the right
  to correct pricing errors and to cancel orders for items that are out of stock or discontinued.
</p>

<h2>5. Delivery</h2>
<p>Orders placed before 5:00 PM on a business day are dispatched the same day; orders placed after this time are sent the following business day.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Shipping area:</strong> We ship to {countries}. We do not deliver to other countries.</li>
  <li><strong>Outside the EU</strong> (Iceland, Switzerland and the UK), customs duties and local taxes may apply and are paid by the recipient on delivery.</li>
  <li><strong>Carriers:</strong> Your goods are shipped with {carriers}.</li>
  <li><strong>Estimated delivery:</strong> Typically {company.deliveryDays} business days after ordering.</li>
  <li>
    <strong>Shipping rates:</strong> The shipping price depends on the country and carrier and is shown at checkout before you pay.
    Shipping is free on orders over DKK {company.freeShippingOver}.
  </li>
</ul>
<p>Special delivery terms may apply to certain goods. These terms will be clearly stated before you buy.</p>

<h2>6. Right of complaint (warranty)</h2>
<p>
  You have a 2-year right of complaint in accordance with Danish law. It covers defects in materials and/or workmanship. Depending on
  the situation, you may have the item repaired or exchanged, receive a refund, or get a reduction in price.
</p>
<p>
  The right of complaint does not cover defects or damage caused by incorrect handling or misuse of the product. You must notify us
  of the defect within a reasonable time after discovering it. For valid claims we cover return shipping costs to a reasonable extent.
</p>
<p>
  Return address for complaints:<br />
  {company.legalName}<br />
  {company.address.map((l) => <>{l === "Danmark" ? "Denmark" : l}<br /></>)}
</p>

<h2>7. Right of withdrawal (returns)</h2>
<p>
  You have a {days}-day full right of withdrawal on goods bought in our web shop. The period begins on the day you (or a third party
  you have designated) take physical possession of the goods.
</p>
<h3>How to withdraw</h3>
<ul>
  <li>You must notify us no later than {days} days after receiving the goods.</li>
  <li>Notification must be sent by email to <a href={`mailto:${company.serviceEmail}`}>{company.serviceEmail}</a>.</li>
  <li>After notifying us, you must return the goods within {days} days.</li>
  <li>You bear the direct costs of returning the goods.</li>
  <li>You cannot withdraw simply by refusing to receive the parcel without giving us clear notice.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Items excluded from the right of withdrawal</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Custom-made goods or items with a clear personal touch.</li>
  <li>Sealed goods which, for health or hygiene reasons, are not suitable for return once the seal is broken.</li>
  <li>Goods that deteriorate or expire rapidly.</li>
  <li>Digital content not delivered on a physical medium, if delivery has begun with your prior express consent.</li>
</ul>

<h2>8. Condition of the item upon return</h2>
<p>
  You are only liable for any diminished value of the goods resulting from handling other than what is necessary to establish the
  nature, characteristics and functioning of the goods. You may examine the item as you would in a physical store, but you must not
  put it into actual use.
</p>
<p>
  If the item has been used beyond this, it is considered used, and you may only receive a partial refund or no refund at all,
  depending on the item's commercial value.
</p>

<h2>9. Refunds</h2>
<p>If you withdraw from your purchase, you will receive a refund of the amount paid. Any depreciation for which you are liable will be deducted.</p>
<p>
  We refund all payments received from you, including standard delivery costs, without undue delay and no later than 14 days from
  the date we receive your notice of withdrawal. We may withhold the refund until we have received the goods back or proof that
  they have been returned.
</p>

<h2>10. Personal data</h2>
<p>To process your order, we need your name, address, phone number and email address, as well as your order history.</p>
<p>
  We only use this information to deliver your goods and handle your enquiries. Read more in our
  <a href={href("en", "privacy")}>privacy policy</a>.
</p>

<h2>11. Governing law and complaints</h2>
<p>These terms and conditions are governed by Danish law.</p>
<p>
  If you have a complaint about a product, please contact us at
  <a href={`mailto:${company.serviceEmail}`}>{company.serviceEmail}</a>. If we cannot find a solution together, you can submit a
  complaint to the Centre for Complaint Resolution at the Danish Board of Appeals (Nævnenes Hus) via
  <a href="https://naevneneshus.dk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">naevneneshus.dk</a>.
</p>
<p>
  If you live in another EU country, you can get help from the European Consumer Centre Denmark (Forbruger Europa) via
  <a href="https://forbrugereuropa.dk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">forbrugereuropa.dk</a>.
</p>
